{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Behold, the eye of YHWH</b> — in the manner of: \"I will set My eye upon him\" and \"set your eye upon him.\"" "<b>To those who fear Him</b> — from Him alone, not from a king who is flesh and blood; and they do not hope except for His kindness alone."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:21.921418034Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}